<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.3500 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.3500 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.3500 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.3000 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     April 8		 April 7</p>
<p> High			     75.3540		 75.3000</p>
<p> Low				75.3000		 75.2500</p>
<p> Open			     75.3000		 75.3000</p>
<p> Close			    75.3500		 75.3000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     4.150		   7.870</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 April 8		 April 4</p>
<p> High			     44.8000		 45.1050</p>
<p> Low				43.8000		 45.1000</p>
<p> Open			     43.8000		 45.1000</p>
<p> Close			    44.8000		 45.1050</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)	    0.025		   0.010</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
